   "id": "B001",
   "text": "December 2008. New York City. Snow was falling on Wall Street.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-00.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/skyline.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": "DECEMBER 2008",
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 350,
   "ms": 5474
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "id": "B002",
   "text": "Investigators walked into a luxury apartment and arrested Bernard Madoff.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-01.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/arrest.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 5824,
   "ms": 5618
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "id": "B003",
   "text": "The seventy year old man ran Wall Street's biggest private fund.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-02.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/suit.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": "MADOFF",
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 11442,
   "ms": 4922
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "id": "B004",
   "text": "For decades people trusted him with their life savings.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-03.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/hands-money.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 16364,
   "ms": 3962
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "id": "B005",
   "text": "Banks trusted him. Charities trusted him. Even other crooks trusted him.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-04.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/bank.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 20326,
   "ms": 5138
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "id": "B006",
   "text": "Then one day he told his sons a terrible secret.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-05.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/two-figures.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": true,
   "startMs": 25464,
   "ms": 3800
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "id": "B007",
   "text": "His famous fund was fake. One giant Ponzi scheme.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-06.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/cycle.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 29264,
   "ms": 4154
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "id": "B008",
   "text": "New money kept flowing in to pay the old investors.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-07.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/cash.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 33418,
   "ms": 3914
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "id": "B009",
   "text": "There was just one problem. The vault was empty.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-08.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/vault.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 37332,
   "ms": 3800
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "id": "B010",
   "text": "Losses reached about sixty five billion dollars. The largest fraud in history.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-09.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/shredded.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": "$65 BILLION",
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 41132,
   "ms": 6002
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "id": "B011",
   "text": "Thousands of ordinary people lost everything they had.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-10.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/crowd.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 47134,
   "ms": 4226
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "id": "B012",
   "text": "In 2009 a judge gave him one hundred fifty years.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-11.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/gavel.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": "150 YEARS",
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 51360,
   "ms": 4226
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "id": "B013",
   "text": "He never got out. He died behind bars in 2021.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-12.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/bars.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": "2021",
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 55586,
   "ms": 4370
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "id": "B014",
   "text": "So how did one man fool the world for forty years?",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-13.mp3",
   "img": "vox-collage/img/magnify.png",
   "card": false,
   "label": null,
   "stamp": null,
   "thread": false,
   "startMs": 59956,
   "ms": 3890
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "id": "B015",
   "text": "He looked safe. He looked boring. And that was the trick.",
   "audio": "vox-collage/audio/beat-14.mp3",
   "img": null,
